content_list.content:
Отлично! У меня теперь есть **полная дизайн-система SmartShell**. Я вижу:

- 🎨 **Тёмная тема**: фон `#0D1217`, карточки `#161C23`
- 🔵 **Акцент синий**: `#2C87FD` (кнопки, ссылки, hover)
- 🟢 **Зелёный** (сходится): `#27AE60`
- 🔴 **Красный** (недостача): `#FF3636`
- 🟠 **Оранжевый** (предупреждение): `#FF7E36`
- 🔤 **Шрифт**: Inter (400, 500, 600, 700)
- 📏 **Border-radius**: 8px
- 💫 **Hover-эффекты** с прозрачными оверлеями

Сейчас применю эту стилистику ко всем окнам.

---

## 1. Создаём `gui/styles.py` — единый источник стилей

```python
"""
Дизайн-система в стилистике SmartShell (dark theme).
Цвета взяты из :root .dark { ... }
"""


# ============================================================
#  ЦВЕТОВАЯ ПАЛИТРА
# ============================================================
class SmartShellColors:
    # Фоны
    BG_PRIMARY = "#0D1217"           # основной фон страницы
    BG_ITEM_PRIMARY = "#161C23"      # фон карточек, таблиц, инпутов
    BG_ITEM_SECONDARY = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)"
    BG_TABS = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)"
    BG_DIVIDER = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)"
    BG_MODAL = "#0D1217"

    # Текст
    TEXT_PRIMARY = "#FFFFFF"
    TEXT_SECONDARY = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5)"
    TEXT_DISABLE = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3)"
    TEXT_LIGHT = "#FFFFFF"
    TEXT_LINK = "#2C87FD"
    TEXT_ERROR = "#FF3636"
    TEXT_WARNING = "#FF7E36"
    TEXT_GREEN = "#27AE60"
    TEXT_VIOLET = "#7C62FF"

    # Иконки
    ICON_PRIMARY = "#FFFFFF"
    ICON_SECONDARY = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5)"

    # Акценты (статусы)
    ACCENT_BLUE = "#2C87FD"
    ACCENT_RED = "#FF3636"
    ACCENT_ORANGE = "#FF7E36"
    ACCENT_GREEN = "#27AE60"
    ACCENT_VIOLET = "#7C62FF"
    ACCENT_WAVE = "#38C9CF"
    ACCENT_PINK = "#B540B8"

    # Полупрозрачные варианты
    BG_BLUE_10 = "rgba(44, 135, 253, 0.1)"
    BG_BLUE_20 = "rgba(44, 135, 253, 0.2)"
    BG_BLUE_30 = "rgba(44, 135, 253, 0.3)"
    BG_RED_10 = "rgba(255, 54, 54, 0.1)"
    BG_RED_20 = "rgba(255, 54, 54, 0.2)"
    BG_GREEN_10 = "rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.1)"
    BG_GREEN_20 = "rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.2)"
    BG_ORANGE_10 = "rgba(255, 126, 54, 0.1)"

    # Кнопки
    BTN_PRIMARY = "#2C87FD"
    BTN_PRIMARY_HOVER = "#297BE6"
    BTN_PRIMARY_PRESSED = "#2670CF"
    BTN_SECONDARY = "rgba(44, 135, 253, 0.1)"
    BTN_SECONDARY_HOVER = "rgba(44, 135, 253, 0.2)"
    BTN_DISABLED = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)"
    BTN_RED_HOVER = "rgba(255, 54, 54, 0.1)"
    BTN_RED_PRIMARY = "rgba(231, 46, 46, 1)"

    # Границы
    BORDER_BLUE = "#2C87FD"
    BORDER_GRAY_10 = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)"
    BORDER_GRAY_20 = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)"
    BORDER_GRAY_30 = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3)"

    # Инпуты
    INPUT_BG = "#161C23"
    INPUT_BG_DISABLED = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)"

    # Тень
    BOX_SHADOW = "rgba(13, 18, 23, 0.8)"


# ============================================================
#  ОБЩИЙ STYLE-SHEET ДЛЯ ПРИЛОЖЕНИЯ
# ============================================================
GLOBAL_STYLE = f"""
/* ============================================================
   БАЗОВЫЕ ЭЛЕМЕНТЫ
   ============================================================ */
QWidget {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_PRIMARY};
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_PRIMARY};
    font-family: "Inter", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
}}

QLabel {{
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_PRIMARY};
    background: transparent;
}}

QLabel[secondary="true"] {{
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_SECONDARY};
}}

/* ============================================================
   КНОПКИ
   ============================================================ */
QPushButton {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BTN_PRIMARY};
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_LIGHT};
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    min-height: 20px;
}}

QPushButton:hover {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BTN_PRIMARY_HOVER};
}}

QPushButton:pressed {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BTN_PRIMARY_PRESSED};
}}

QPushButton:disabled {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BTN_DISABLED};
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_DISABLE};
}}

/* Вторичная кнопка (ghost) */
QPushButton[variant="secondary"] {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BTN_SECONDARY};
    color: {SmartShellColors.ACCENT_BLUE};
}}
QPushButton[variant="secondary"]:hover {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BTN_SECONDARY_HOVER};
}}

/* Опасная кнопка (красная) */
QPushButton[variant="danger"] {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BTN_RED_PRIMARY};
}}
QPushButton[variant="danger"]:hover {{
    background-color: #c72626;
}}

/* ============================================================
   ИНПУТЫ
   ============================================================ */
QLineEdit {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.INPUT_BG};
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_PRIMARY};
    border: 1px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_GRAY_20};
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-size: 14px;
    selection-background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_BLUE_30};
}}

QLineEdit:focus {{
    border: 1px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_BLUE};
}}

QLineEdit:disabled {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.INPUT_BG_DISABLED};
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_DISABLE};
}}

QLineEdit::placeholder {{
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_DISABLE};
}}

/* ============================================================
   КОМБОБОКСЫ
   ============================================================ */
QComboBox {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.INPUT_BG};
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_PRIMARY};
    border: 1px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_GRAY_20};
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-size: 14px;
    min-height: 20px;
}}

QComboBox:hover {{
    border: 1px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_GRAY_30};
}}

QComboBox:focus {{
    border: 1px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_BLUE};
}}

QComboBox::drop-down {{
    border: none;
    width: 30px;
    subcontrol-origin: padding;
    subcontrol-position: top right;
}}

QComboBox::down-arrow {{
    image: none;
    border-left: 5px solid transparent;
    border-right: 5px solid transparent;
    border-top: 6px solid {SmartShellColors.TEXT_SECONDARY};
    margin-right: 12px;
}}

QComboBox QAbstractItemView {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_ITEM_PRIMARY};
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_PRIMARY};
    border: 1px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_GRAY_20};
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 4px;
    outline: none;
    selection-background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_BLUE_20};
    selection-color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_PRIMARY};
}}

QComboBox QAbstractItemView::item {{
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    min-height: 20px;
}}

QComboBox QAbstractItemView::item:hover {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_BLUE_10};
}}

QComboBox QAbstractItemView::item:selected {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_BLUE_20};
}}

/* ============================================================
   ЧЕКБОКСЫ
   ============================================================ */
QCheckBox {{
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_PRIMARY};
    spacing: 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
    background: transparent;
}}

QCheckBox::indicator {{
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.INPUT_BG};
    border: 1.5px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_GRAY_30};
}}

QCheckBox::indicator:hover {{
    border-color: {SmartShellColors.ACCENT_BLUE};
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_BLUE_10};
}}

QCheckBox::indicator:checked {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.ACCENT_BLUE};
    border-color: {SmartShellColors.ACCENT_BLUE};
    image: none;
}}

/* ============================================================
   ТАБЛИЦЫ
   ============================================================ */
QTableWidget {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_ITEM_PRIMARY};
    alternate-background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_PRIMARY};
    border: 1px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_GRAY_20};
    border-radius: 8px;
    gridline-color: {SmartShellColors.BORDER_GRAY_10};
    font-size: 14px;
    selection-background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_BLUE_20};
    selection-color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_PRIMARY};
}}

QTableWidget::item {{
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_GRAY_10};
}}

QTableWidget::item:selected {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_BLUE_20};
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_PRIMARY};
}}

QHeaderView::section {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_PRIMARY};
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_SECONDARY};
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_GRAY_20};
    border-right: 1px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_GRAY_10};
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}}

QHeaderView::section:last {{
    border-right: none;
}}

/* ============================================================
   СКРОЛЛБАРЫ (как у SmartShell)
   ============================================================ */
QScrollBar:vertical {{
    background: {SmartShellColors.BG_PRIMARY};
    width: 14px;
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
}}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical {{
    background: {SmartShellColors.ACCENT_BLUE};
    border: 5px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 8px;
    min-height: 30px;
    background-clip: padding-box;
}}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical:hover {{
    background: {SmartShellColors.BTN_PRIMARY_HOVER};
    background-clip: padding-box;
}}

QScrollBar::add-line:vertical, QScrollBar::sub-line:vertical {{
    height: 0px;
}}

QScrollBar:horizontal {{
    background: {SmartShellColors.BG_PRIMARY};
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
}}

QScrollBar::handle:horizontal {{
    background: {SmartShellColors.ACCENT_BLUE};
    border: 5px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 8px;
    min-width: 30px;
    background-clip: padding-box;
}}

QScrollBar::add-line:horizontal, QScrollBar::sub-line:horizontal {{
    width: 0px;
}}

/* ============================================================
   ДИАЛОГИ И МОДАЛКИ
   ============================================================ */
QDialog {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_MODAL};
}}

/* ============================================================
   TOOLTIPS
   ============================================================ */
QToolTip {{
    background-color: {SmartShellColors.BG_ITEM_PRIMARY};
    color: {SmartShellColors.TEXT_PRIMARY};
    border: 1px solid {SmartShellColors.BORDER_GRAY_20};
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
}}
"""


def apply_global_style(app):
    """Применяет SmartShell-стиль ко всему QApplication."""
    app.setStyleSheet(GLOBAL_STYLE)
```

